# How to cite this software, shown by GitHub's "Cite this repository". The
# version names the latest release; tests/test_version.py holds it, the licence
# and the repository to pyproject.toml.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: AM_segmentation_manager
abstract: >-
  Curate, proofread and export the segmentation labels of FIB/SEM images from
  Autolamella's adaptive milling: index a collection of projects, correct their
  metadata, choose which images to label, prepare and proofread labels, measure
  them, and export filtered tables for data deposition and model training.
authors:
